# .env.example - Example Environment Variables Template
#
# OptiForge is a local, decentralized multi-agent simulation.
# Copy this template to .env if you wish to set container or shell-level environment flags:
#
# SWARM_SEED=42
# NUM_DRONES=8
# NUM_SURVIVORS=10
# TICK_COMPUTE_BUDGET_MS=25.0
# SIMULATION_MAX_TICKS=200
